So this is the in this case, we're minimizing the&nbsp;
square of the error of the surrogate model. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:51.280
notice like we have an expectation here. So that's&nbsp;
sort of like over the joint distribution of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

