empirical mean square error. So this setup,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:34.520
I think is, has become quite widespread and maybe&nbsp;
familiar. All right, so this is the problem that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:42.920
